2:T51e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games","headline":"The Voice of Cheese Worm for WORMS","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Guy Harris is the voice of Cheese Worm in WORMS, bringing character, comedy and energy to one of Team17's most iconic game franchises.","datePublished":"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["voice of worms","worms voice actor","cheese worm voice","team17 worms voiceover","video game character voice actor","guy harris worms","worms game voices"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/cheese-worm-team-17-voice.jpg"}}6:["slug","voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games","d"]
0:["uZlw_rSN16EBLe2H5Gx5t",[[["",{"children":[["slug","voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"The Voice of Cheese Worm for WORMS\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games\"}]}"}}],["$","script","schema-2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games#video\",\"name\":\"The Voice of Cheese Worm for WORMS\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/EKBZmTXi67U/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EKBZmTXi67U\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Guy Harris is the voice of Cheese Worm in WORMS, bringing character, comedy and energy to one of Team17's most iconic game franchises.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2025-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The Voice of Cheese Worm for WORMS"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Back for my fifth WORMS game, I returned to voice Cheese Worm for one of gaming's most loved and recognisable franchises.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>When I was first asked to be part of <strong>WORMS</strong> many years ago, I had no idea just how big and beloved the game was. Out of all the <a href=\"/\" title=\"British Male Voiceover Artist\">projects I get to voice</a>, this is one that genuinely surprises people the most when I mention it.</p><p>If I tell anyone who is even slightly into video games that I voice many of the characters in <strong>WORMS</strong>, they are usually blown away. It is one of those titles people have grown up with, played with friends, laughed along with and remembered for years. So yes, there is a very good chance that the worms you have been hearing over the last 10+ years have mostly been me. You can hear some of that work on my <a href=\"/worms-wmd-character-voices\" title=\"Worms WMD Character Voices\">Worms W.M.D character voices page</a>.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EKBZmTXi67U","title":"The Voice of Cheese Worm for WORMS","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/cheese-worm-team-17-voice.jpg","alt":"The Voice of Cheese Worm for WORMS","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>The <strong>WORMS</strong> games are known for their chaotic turn-based battles, where teams of cartoon worms take each other on using everything from bazookas and grenades to exploding sheep and completely ridiculous weapons. That mix of strategy, silliness and total mayhem is exactly what has made the series so popular for so long.</p><p>Voicing a character like Cheese Worm means finding the right level of personality, energy and comedy so the <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">voice fits perfectly</a> into that madcap world. The performance needs to feel playful, distinctive and memorable, helping give the game even more character while matching the offbeat humour fans expect from <strong>Team17's WORMS</strong>.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I do not normally speak in quite such a high-pitched way in everyday life, which is probably a relief to everyone around me. But if you are looking for <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voice work</a> with real personality, energy and flexibility, I can certainly help. If you would like to know more about my voice work for <strong>WORMS</strong>, <strong>Team17</strong> or any other game or character project, please do get in touch using the form below.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"The Voice of Cheese Worm for WORMS","pageUrl":"voice-of-cheese-worm-in-worms-games"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","712",{"href":"/rakbank-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/rakbank-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Rakbank Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Rakbank Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","920",{"href":"/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice.jpg","alt":"just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Just Eat UEFA Football Commentator"}]]}],["$","$L3","558",{"href":"/pathe-news-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pathe-news-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Pathe News Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Pathe News Voiceover"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/7c08e83cf1ba7081.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en-GB","children":[["$","head",null,{"children":[["